SetHalted_Concrete_Test
├── when halting
│   ├── when the caller is neither the guardian nor the operator
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when the caller is the guardian or the operator
│       ├── it should halt the contract, even one already halted
│       └── it should emit {HaltChanged}
└── when resuming
    ├── when the caller is not the operator
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the caller is the operator
        ├── it should resume the contract
        └── it should emit {HaltChanged}
